      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Zeb\u012bd</em>:\u00a0It is a city among the <em>Teh\u0101\u2019im-i Yemen</em> (the Yemeni Tihama / the coastal plain of Yemen), lying half a stage\u2019s distance from the shore of the sea.<br data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"304\" /> It is situated on flat ground, and all of its water comes from wells.\u00a0Its city wall has eight gates.\u00a0The coast near it is called <em>\u2018Al\u0101nife</em>, and the distance between the city and the shore is fifteen miles. [translation]</p>",
